{
  "rationale": "The plant models the robot's perception and actuation interface, separating sensing (uncontrollable events) from motion (controllable events). The specification enforces safe, efficient exploration: move_forward is only enabled when the path is clear, and rotate_clockwise is the only allowed recovery action upon any obstacle. Recovery states only allow rotate_clockwise and return to forward progress only after path_clear. All uncontrollables are total, and the controller is deterministic and non-blocking.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model perception and motion as a single plant automaton with all sensor and motion events.",
    "Specification enforces: move_forward only in clear, rotate_clockwise as the only recovery, and rapid return to exploration after path_clear."
